"yourself/edison.html>`__ 设置并用作协同计算机，主要与 `The Cube "
"<http://www.proficnc.com/content/13-pixhawk2>`__ 配合使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/intel-edison.rst:16 7d5bb1d7478a4378972a234056dfb830
