msgstr "购买渠道"

#: ../../source/docs/intel-edison.rst:25 deeed744afb1409aa9e6533b6cef4e4e
msgid ""
"The Edison can be `purchased from Sparkfun here "
"<https://www.sparkfun.com/products/13024>`__."
msgstr "Edison 可以在 `Sparkfun 购买 <https://www.sparkfun.com/products/13024>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/intel-edison.rst:27 91de8ff9b96f48c8bfc9e048d3640166
msgid ""
"The Cube with carrier board can be purchased from one of these `retailers "
"<http://www.proficnc.com/stores>`__.  Be sure to purchase a Cube with the "
"Intel Edison compatible carrier board."
msgstr ""
"带载板的 The Cube 可从以下 `零售商 <http://www.proficnc.com/stores>`__ 之一购买。请确保购买附带 "
"Intel Edison 兼容载板的 Cube。"

#: ../../source/docs/intel-edison.rst:30 78332478d1484b23b138a395de7aa394
msgid "Installing the Edison in The Cube"
msgstr "将 Edison 安装到 The Cube 中"

#: ../../source/docs/intel-edison.rst:32 22d21146d9ce4c9896cb32f70f1fecab
msgid "To install the Edison into The Cube Carrier board:"
msgstr "将 Edison 安装到 The Cube 载板中的步骤："

#: ../../source/docs/intel-edison.rst:34 ae9b2b005fff4cc4be9ac66e658b510d
msgid "Remove the four side screews from The Cube"
msgstr "拧下 The Cube 两侧的四颗螺丝"

#: ../../source/docs/intel-edison.rst:39 ac972867968e4cfda9df0cd6109ee2ad
msgid ""
"Remove the four hex screws on the bottom of the carrier board and lift the "
"bottom cover to reveal the socket for the edison."
msgstr "拧下载板底部的四颗六角螺丝，掀开底盖以露出 Edison 的插槽。"

#: ../../source/docs/intel-edison.rst:44 14c5768c3e454b648c7fe25a2a3f7f82
msgid ""
"Remove the philips screws that will later hold the Edison in place. Place "
"the Intel Edison into its socket and use the screws to hold it in place.  It"
" should now look like the top-most image on this page (see above)"
msgstr "拧下用于固定 Edison 的十字螺丝，将 Intel Edison 插入插槽后再用螺丝固定。此时应与本页顶部的图片一致（见上方）。"

#: ../../source/docs/intel-edison.rst:45 8fde4e09e08a49e7a60b4754541e4403
msgid ""
"Replace the bottom cover in the reverse order to the instructions above"
msgstr "按照上述步骤的相反顺序重新装上底盖"

#: ../../source/docs/intel-edison.rst:48 6a10ab06dad3436ca0aa15c0671f701c
msgid "Setting up the Edison"
msgstr "设置 Edison"

#: ../../source/docs/intel-edison.rst:52 2eadaf99bf00454595e17b1868481d33
