#: ../../source/docs/intel-edison.rst:54 b59f9a2f24f1452fa9950cc2c823524b
msgid ""
"The easiest way to get started is to flash the Edison with the :ref:`APSync "
"<apsync-intro>` image recommended by the ArduPilot team:"
