"Download the `latest image from firmware.ardupilot.org "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Companion/apsync/>`__. Look for the file "
"starting with \"apsync-edison\"."
msgstr ""
"从 `firmware.ardupilot.org 下载最新镜像 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Companion/apsync/>`__。查找以「apsync-"
"edison」开头的文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/intel-edison.rst:57 0199f98aa08f464483d63f0dc1670e93
msgid "Extract/Unzip the image (a \"toFlash\" directory should appear):"
