"Ubuntu users can right-mouse-button-click and select \"Extract Here\" or "
"type ``tar -xzvf intel_edison_image_latest.tar.gz``"
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu 用户可以右键单击并选择「在此处解压」，或输入 ``tar -xzvf intel_edison_image_latest.tar.gz``"

