#: ../../source/docs/intel-edison.rst:76 28f9ef058b9644609b5b84f7785ff3e6
msgid ""
"Connect your PC to The Cube using the USB cables as shown below.  The USB "
"cable connected to the Cube (the black cable shown below) provides power.  "
"The two USB cables connected to the carrier board (shown as white cables) "
"enable flashing the image to the edison.  If possible connect the \"OTG port"
" Flashing\" using the flat USB cable that comes with The Cube because it "
"provides the most reliable connection."
msgstr ""
"按下图所示，使用 USB 线将您的电脑连接到 The Cube。连接至 Cube 的 USB 线（下图中的黑色线缆）提供电源。连接至载板的两根 USB "
"线（白色线缆）用于将镜像刷写到 Edison。如有可能，请使用 The Cube 附带的扁平 USB 线连接「OTG "
"端口刷写」，因为它提供最稳定的连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/intel-edison.rst:86 9084b10d7cbc457a882dae5ddbe19014
msgid ""
"On a Windows machine, the Intel Edison should show up in the Device Manager "
"as shown in the image below"
msgstr "在 Windows 机器上，Intel Edison 应在设备管理器中显示，如下图所示"

#: ../../source/docs/intel-edison.rst:92 b52db06e77b14558be68afaefe12d49f
msgid "Flash the image:"
msgstr "刷写镜像："

#: ../../source/docs/intel-edison.rst:94 77168784eb4f49d6847aa8a7f99ff7a6
msgid ""
"On Windows double click on the ``flashall.bat`` script found in the "
"``toFlash`` directory or Open a command prompt window navigate to the "
"``toFlash`` folder and run ``flashall.bat`` to see the output"
msgstr ""
"在 Windows 上，双击 ``toFlash`` 目录中的 ``flashall.bat`` 脚本，或打开命令提示符窗口，导航至 "
"``toFlash`` 文件夹并运行 ``flashall.bat`` 以查看输出"

#: ../../source/docs/intel-edison.rst:95 53542ef228a44f5ebaafbf8306f44142
msgid ""
"On Ubuntu and OS X cd into the ``toFlash`` directory and enter, "
"``./flashall.sh``"
msgstr "在 Ubuntu 和 OS X 上，切换到 ``toFlash`` 目录并执行 ``./flashall.sh``"

#: ../../source/docs/intel-edison.rst:96 21d645c1648a444f907cd1bca6254cd7
msgid ""
"If/when you see a prompt, \"Now waiting for dfu device 8087:0a99, Please "
"plug and reboot the board\", unplug and then plug back in the USB cable "
"connected to the Cube (i.e. the one providing power)"
msgstr ""
"如果看到提示「Now waiting for dfu device 8087:0a99, Please plug and reboot the "
"board」，请拔出并重新插入连接到 Cube 的 USB 线（即提供电源的那根）"

#: ../../source/docs/intel-edison.rst:101 65f8b001cb1d42fdb40abe73eb10a3c3
msgid ""
"After flashing is done, wait 1 to 2 min before cutting power to the Edison"
msgstr "刷写完成后，等待 1 到 2 分钟再断开 Edison 的电源"

#: ../../source/docs/intel-edison.rst:104 9ae34590e7c04bb8ab79dc1ca7b0d9a0
msgid "Setting up The Cube"
msgstr "设置 The Cube"

#: ../../source/docs/intel-edison.rst:106 708c79aa1efe400c93f4ad94f51ad705
msgid ""
"Connect to The Cube with a ground station (i.e. Mission Planner) and set the"
" following parameters:"
msgstr "使用地面站（如 Mission Planner）连接到 The Cube，并设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/intel-edison.rst:108 b6378e93270c4f2badb4924d31e5d046
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <copter:SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 1 (the default) to "
"enable MAVLink on the serial port."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <copter:SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 1（默认值），以在串口上启用 MAVLink。"

#: ../../source/docs/intel-edison.rst:109 76145e561b8a44e0a779c6943ef175bf
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <copter:SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 921 so The Cube can communicate "
"with the Edison at 921600 baud."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <copter:SERIAL2_BAUD>` = 921，使 The Cube 能够以 921600 波特率与 "
"Edison 通信。"

#: ../../source/docs/intel-edison.rst:110 0eaa19df04ff4cfc9d74abfd2601e24d
msgid ""
":ref:`LOG_BACKEND_TYPE <copter:LOG_BACKEND_TYPE>` = 3 if you are using "
"APSync to stream the dataflash log files to the Edison"
msgstr ""
":ref:`LOG_BACKEND_TYPE <copter:LOG_BACKEND_TYPE>` = 3，如果您正在使用 APSync 将 "
"dataflash 日志文件流式传输到 Edison"

