#: ../../source/docs/intel-edison.rst:185 3251f3f1e3e749e1857493db15710fce
msgid "Archived Instructions"
msgstr "存档说明"

#: ../../source/docs/intel-edison.rst:187 6180eb7618564954b8d1bbc5d0d6267d
msgid ""
"The following instructions were written before the standard image was "
"created and are not useful for most users."
msgstr "以下说明是在标准镜像创建之前编写的，对大多数用户不适用。"

#: ../../source/docs/intel-edison.rst:189 88d67aef9731406da6286f85836dbbd6
msgid ""
"`Download "
"<https://communities.intel.com/docs/DOC-23242?_ga=1.100203546.523605939.1416692974>`__"
